# Reused Components Notice

This project includes adapted/reused code and assets from:
- Amethyst-Android (AngelAuraMC)
- PojavLauncher upstream components
- OpenJDK launcher bridge sources
- LWJGL bridge classes and method injector artifacts shipped by Amethyst

Reused JNI bridge modules include (non-exhaustive):
- `jre_launcher.c`
- `input_bridge_v3.c`
- `egl_bridge.c`
- `awt_bridge.c`
- `ctxbridges/*`, `environ/*`, `jvm_hooks/*`, `native_hooks/*`

Original copyright and license headers in reused source files were preserved where present.
See `THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md` for attribution summary.

